  "description": "Heo Woo-Dae, the slacker of slackers, always running away, turning a blind eye, making excuses, and blaming others. At the age of 42, he's lost his fortune in coin business, fired from his job, and about to be kicked out of his home. He travels back in time to meet his former lover, Jo Ah-Young, now a super-popular writer. Will he be able to become her husband?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
